{
  "_note": "Exercise profiles for rep segmentation and per-rep metrics. 'driver' signals are averaged; a rep is one peak of the driver. Signals: OpenSim coordinate names, or derived 'torso.sagittal', 'torso.frontal', 'pelvis.sagittal', 'pelvis.frontal', 'head.sagittal', 'knee_fppa_r', 'knee_fppa_l', 'lumbar_total.sagittal|frontal|transverse' (sum over lumbar levels).",
